				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="alt-faq-q">
				<h3>Does iRedMail have a sending API or inbound webhooks?</h3>
				<p>
					No. iRedMail is a classic mail server. SMTP submission with mailbox credentials
					is the only programmatic surface, and inbound mail lands in mailboxes only.
					There's no REST API for sending, no inbound webhooks, no domain-scoped API keys.
					Vectis Mail ships 40+ REST endpoints covering sending, inbound webhooks,
